{"id": "E000065", "payload": {"analyst": "systems", "text": "Does the hospital have a master patient index?", "why": "coverage checklist"}, "type": "question"}
{"id": "E000066", "payload": {"analyst": "systems", "question_id": "E000065", "text": "There is no master index and never was. Each department assigns its own account numbers; the vendor sells an index as a separate module the hospital did not buy."}, "type": "answer"}
